Subject: [A14 platform 02/18] audio stereo

Extracted mechanically from Python rewrite 2 in the tested postPatch recipe.
No resulting source changes; existing diagnostics and workarounds are retained.
Apply in the order in kernel/a14-post-patch.nix, after its DT appends.
The existing bank0 patch remains between platform patches 09 and 10.

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/x1e80100.c b/sound/soc/qcom/x1e80100.c
--- a/sound/soc/qcom/x1e80100.c
+++ b/sound/soc/qcom/x1e80100.c
@@ -79,6 +79,16 @@
 
 	rate->min = rate->max = 48000;
 	switch (cpu_dai->id) {
+	case WSA_CODEC_DMA_RX_0:
+	case WSA_CODEC_DMA_RX_1:
